@* =================================================================================================
   FILE: Maroos.Web/Components/Account/Pages/Lockout.razor                  URL: /Account/Lockout
   ORIGIN: generated by the Blazor Identity template; Maroos uses it unchanged.
   PURPOSE: Shown after too many wrong passwords. Maroos locks an account for 15 minutes after 5 failures
   (Program.cs), which slows down password guessing.
   ================================================================================================= *@
@page "/Account/Lockout"

<PageTitle>Locked out</PageTitle>

<header>
    <h1 class="text-danger">Locked out</h1>
    <p class="text-danger" role="alert">This account has been locked out, please try again later.</p>
</header>
